Package: RandallRecipes
Type: Package
Title: Recipe Exploration Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Destini", "Randall",
      email = "destinirandall@yahoo.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package provides a dataset of recipes and uses functions for searching, filtering, and visualizing them.
  Users can search for specific recipes, generate random ones, and filter them based on ingredients.
  There is also a functions allowing users to graph recipes and compare their characteristics.
  This package is intended for culinary students, chefs, and anyone interested in exploring recipe data.
Imports: ggplot2, jsonlite, tidyr
